{"parse": {"title": "灵魂影映-07", "pageid": 119382, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-06\" title=\"灵魂影映-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">灵魂影映-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-08\" title=\"灵魂影映-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">灵魂影映</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E5.A4.8D.E6.B4.BB.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“复活”\">“复活”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “复活”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">\"Resurrection\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>他叫什么名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的妇人：</div><div>格拉克……他的名字叫格拉克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的妇人：</div><div>格拉克很喜欢吃酸奶，他喜欢吃最酸的、不放一点糖的那种。他还喜欢睡在刚收完麦子的田里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的妇人：</div><div>这是格拉克的一顶帽子，他只要一出门就戴着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人颤抖的手捏着一顶带有烧焦痕迹的毡帽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的妇人：</div><div>孩子，格拉克一定可以回来的，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩将笛子竖在嘴边，只吹响了短促的一声，一个矮小的、戴着帽子的影子缓缓升起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的妇人：</div><div>上帝啊……格拉克！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的妇人：</div><div>我的孩子……呜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个自称是血食怪的孩子能够复活死者，带回彷徨的灵魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战火蔓延至这座小镇，带走无数性命，人们像抓住救命稻草一样抓住她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管在硝烟弥漫的现实中，“复活”听上去像个童话故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去亲人的老者：</div><div>野树莓，孩子，这是她的遗物……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-629501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-629501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-629501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去亲人的孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>野树莓姐姐，我的妈妈……她今天过得好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的母亲：</div><div>野树莓，我这里有一些食物，请你一定收下……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的母亲：</div><div>米列娜吃不了东西，至少你要多吃一点。米列娜也会为你高兴的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去亲人的孩子Ⅱ：</div><div>姐姐，纽扣、发夹，你用得上吗？都给你……我在废墟里捡到的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去亲人的孩子Ⅱ：</div><div>我这里还有橙子……爷爷以前很喜欢吃橙子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的父亲：</div><div>嘿，野树莓！这是不是你想要的红药水？我找到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的父亲：</div><div>快拿着吧，彭卡和特尔维尔一定把你吵死了，他们就没有歇下来的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的父亲：</div><div>彭卡他小时候啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怀里被塞满了东西，野树莓有些无措地站在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们竭尽全力找到食物、药品、生活用品，想要和这位小小血食怪达成交易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人祈求，有人报答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脑海之中传来熟悉的声音。现在，无需借助影子，她也可以听到家人的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的母亲”：</div><div>孩子，你应当收下一些，保全你的生活。要知道，你联结了这么多的灵魂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的母亲”：</div><div>你无比重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的父亲”：</div><div>血食怪不易，人类更加不易！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的父亲”：</div><div>如果没有战争，他们本可以过普普通通的一生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的父亲”：</div><div>唉！血食怪虽然强大，但被迫成为血食怪可不好受……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“小尼古拉”：</div><div>姐姐，你变成了老大！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“小尼古拉”：</div><div>像阿诺德五世那样，人人敬仰，是不是，姐姐？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们热切的目光注视着小小的血食怪，等她召出影子，再唤出灵魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只要可以再次和逝去的亲人交谈，血食怪对他们来说不再是传说故事，而是最重要的真实历史。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>血食怪不会因为自己是血食怪，而这样谋求好处的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>你们的亲人和我的家人一样，都已经活在影子里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我向你们保证！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>无论有没有这些东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音未落，她的目光落到一小块冷却的肉饼上，胃部立刻传来一阵抽搐，以及一声明显的响动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>……呃！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我不是……我只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她又变回一个十足的孩子了，忍饥受饿已久，她即使能召回无数灵魂，也无法掩盖这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的母亲：</div><div>吃吧，吃吧！野树莓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-627401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的母亲：</div><div>血食怪也吃人类的食物，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的父亲：</div><div>你总不能一直受饿，野树莓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的父亲：</div><div>你可还是个孩子呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低声喃喃了一句，动作迟疑地拿起那一小块肉饼，咬进嘴里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>唔……唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>好吃……我有好久没有吃过肉饼了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>谢、谢谢你们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她最终留下了那瓶红药水，还有一点食物，足以让她再支撑一阵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的眼睛透过红色药水的瓶身，眼前的景象变得血红了。而她的瞳孔仿佛也被这红色液体染成红色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼睛看着变成血红色的世界，眨了一下，又一下。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>那个能复活死者的野树莓在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>听说她会出现在有尸体的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>抓到的几个平民不肯说她的下落，但是复活死者这件事，好像是真的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>那杀掉那几个平民不就成了？把她引出来，然后抓住她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>她很狡猾，还有那些影子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>我们有几个重要的通讯兵死在平民自卫队手里了，如果那个野树莓能复活他们的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>当然得把她找出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>头儿，你有什么办法？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军衔稍高的士兵用脚碾了碾坟地的尘土，说话的声音放大了一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>没什么办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>只要一死人她就出现，我也只好杀几个人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>你去把那几个人带过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>是！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不用了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>昏暗的树下出现人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我确实可以复活死者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>不过——只有血食怪才能起死回生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>所以他们复活之后，会变成真正的血食怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>我只要那些死人口里的情报，不管他们会变成什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他一边道，一边朝手下递了眼色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一支手枪在士兵身侧悄悄抬起，对准站在地上的双脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>野树莓，如果你能带来军队想要的，少不了你的奖励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>什么奖励？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>你想要什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>唔，我想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的话语顿住，好像陷入了一种贪婪的思考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>砰！子弹从枪口发射出去，在昏暗的夜色之中闪烁着火光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一枪极准，树下的身影应声而倒，发出痛苦的呻吟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>把她抓起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军靴摩擦地面发出急促的脚步声。士兵们冲到树下，只看到一个浓黑的影子，渐渐消散了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>“复活”需要在足够明亮的黑夜里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音换了方向，从更远的地方传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>满月的时候，我在这里等你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>带上你们准备的“奖励”吧……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "灵魂影映-07"}}